<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1311427648"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1485694787"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Episode 33"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="She Her Her Hers"/><amll:meta key="album" value="SPIRAL"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:06.270"><div begin="00:22.408" end="03:06.270"><p begin="00:22.408" end="00:26.614" itunes:key="L3039">感じて　今夜は見事さ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用心感受的今夜 旖旎非常</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n ji te ko n ya ha mi go to sa</span></p><p begin="00:27.505" end="00:33.346" itunes:key="L3040">見栄も、弱みさえもない　まさに上出来だ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没有虚荣 亦无弱点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e mo yo wa mi sa e mo na i</span></p><p begin="00:34.051" end="00:38.794" itunes:key="L3041">まぁ、そういったノリは出せずFin<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不过 如曾言语 索然无味</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma so u i 't ta no ri ha da se zu fin</span></p><p begin="00:39.509" end="00:45.341" itunes:key="L3042">赤のトランスフォームスーツはとても着こなせない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">红色的变装西服</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ka no to ra n su fo o mu su u tsu ha</span></p><p begin="00:46.254" end="00:54.081" itunes:key="L3043">真夜中生まれる　感情をうまく纏えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能将午夜诞生的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo na ka u ma re ru</span></p><p begin="00:58.051" end="01:00.643" itunes:key="L3044">もうパッと言えるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为已能利落言说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u pa 't to i e ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:01.804" end="01:06.146" itunes:key="L3045">この気持ちをどうぞ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就请享用这份感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ki mo chi wo do u zo</span></p><p begin="02:22.456" end="02:26.587" itunes:key="L3046">演じて　今夜も見事さ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">装模作样的今夜 亦美轮美奂</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e n ji te ko n ya mo mi go to sa</span></p><p begin="02:27.506" end="02:33.381" itunes:key="L3047">見えなくていいものばかり披露する<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">揭露的净是些</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e na ku te i i mo no ba ka ri</span></p><p begin="02:34.402" end="02:38.622" itunes:key="L3048">転じて　福を期待したい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">转而愿意期待福运</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te n ji te fu ku wo ki ta i shi ta i</span></p><p begin="02:39.501" end="02:45.295" itunes:key="L3049">何度目のあやかり　受け身が続いてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续接受</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na n do me no a ya ka ri</span></p><p begin="02:46.249" end="02:54.048" itunes:key="L3050">真夜中生まれる　感情をうまく纏えたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若被深夜诞生的感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo na ka u ma re ru</span></p><p begin="02:58.053" end="03:00.443" itunes:key="L3051">もうパッと言えるから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">毕竟已能利落言说</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u pa 't to i e ru ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:01.802" end="03:06.270" itunes:key="L3052">この気持ちを理解して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也请理解 这种心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ki mo chi wo ri ka i shi te</span></p></div></body></tt>